From: Prospero Win contributors <prospero-win@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: add opt-in native shared mutex backend and exact cache

Depends on 0810 server authority and lifetime preparation. Native ABI and
handle cache avoid server locking on successful shared-word operations.
The exact-1 WINE_PS5_MUTEX_SHARED/pw_mutex_shared switch is default off.
Full Wine semantics and console performance remain validation gates.

